A few folks have pointed out that Marvin would pretty much be guaranteed to win
as a clan of 1 if it were set up as highest average score.  That also removes
the teamwork and social aspects of it.

How about a scoring system for clans, like:

+1		per member
+3		per class 1st place
+2		per class 2nd place
+1		per class 3rd place
+3		per additional trophy position
+1		per ascension

This would definitely weight it away from individuals, since a player 
may only have 1 class trophy.  Even marvin would have a hard time 
holing his own as a clan of 1 in a system like that.

-robin

